"They said, 'We&#x2019;d love to continue making movies with you. Steve would no longer be Captain America, he would be Nomad,'" Evans said. "They sent me a pitch, and it was a great pitch. It really was. But for whatever reason at the time, I was very happy with how things wrapped up. It didn&#x2019;t feel like it was the thing I was looking to do at the time."

At the end of Endgame , Steve and Peggy Carter (Hayley Atwell) travel back in time to live their life. Steve then appears in the present day as an old man to pass the baton to Sam Wilson. However, in the Doomsday trailer, Steve and Peggy look like they haven't aged, which could mean they are time traveling through the multi-verse.

EXCLUSIVE: Lily James is attached to star in and produce a feature adaptation of Lucy Foley &#x2019;s bestselling novel The Hunting Party for Universal Pictures. James will produce and Gala Gordon will co-produce for Parodos with Molly Sims will produce and Gaby McCormick will co-produce for Something Happy Productions. No writer is currently attached.

A Sunday Times and New York Times bestseller, The Hunting Party follows a group of old Oxford friends whose holiday reunion at a remote hunting lodge turns deadly when a blizzard leaves them snowbound, and one of them is found murdered. The novel established Foley as a leading voice in commercial thrillers and was shortlisted for Crime & Thriller Book of the Year at the British Book Awards. Not to be confused with the NBC procedural drama of the same name created by J.J. Bailey that aired for two seasons between 2025 and 2026, Foley's The Hunting Party was published in December 2018. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

